  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is the constant of integration). The range of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> as <math><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is <math><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> The value of <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0.25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know, <math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math><br />Thus, <math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />i.e. <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Hence, range is <math><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mn>5</mn></math>"
  }
